    "answer": {
      "short": "\\$4600 per month; increase the Step 3 base salary by 6%, add the Leader 2 allowance, then divide by 12.",
      "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\text{Base salary} &= 45\\,000+45\\,000\\times0.06 = \\$47\\,700\\\\\\text{Gross annual pay} &= 47\\,700+7500 = \\$55\\,200\\\\\\text{Gross monthly pay} &= 55\\,200\\div12 = \\$4600\\end{align*}$$",
